    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/55992c7b036d576a80bd5333a687cb7d.avif?t=1746789781\" width=550 height=73 /></span> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/278755de074d1530ee1d7ae5d6204d66.poster.avif?t=1746789781\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/278755de074d1530ee1d7ae5d6204d66.webm?t=1746789781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/278755de074d1530ee1d7ae5d6204d66.mp4?t=1746789781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Master the Elements. Dominate the Arena. Embrace the Madness!</strong> \ud83d\udd25<br>Enter a world where magic isn\u2019t just power\u2014it\u2019s a way of life. <strong>Magic Madness</strong> is a fast-paced <strong>VR multiplayer battle</strong> where up to <strong>eight opponents</strong> face off in elemental combat, harnessing the raw forces of <strong>wood, fire, earth, metal, and water</strong>. Master unique <strong>spells</strong>, adapt to <strong>dynamic arenas</strong>, and outwit your opponents in a test of <strong>skill, strategy, and reflexes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodge, throw, and cast spells with precision\u2014every move matters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/363fb5e0eb6e3fdb853ceb025c35977a.avif?t=1746789781\" width=456 height=75 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/272c7fab503238940ceb54d3f8199d54.avif?t=1746789781\" width=616 height=204 /></span><strong></strong>Play as a <strong>Brock Lee</strong>, a <strong>Cobra Flash</strong>, or other <strong>unique characters</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/cf032564689774885662d83c0d37251c.webp?t=1746789781\" width=615 height=34 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/a78fdd9f72c4057a1edec15cbd999e05.avif?t=1746789781\" width=616 height=204 /></span><br>\ud83c\udf32 <strong>Wood</strong> \u2013 The essence of growth, renewal, and creative expansion, thriving through flow and adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Fire</strong> \u2013 The element of passion, destruction, and transformation. It fuels chaos and intensity, bringing both danger and renewal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Earth</strong> \u2013 A foundation of stability and endurance. Earth represents resilience, structure, and the strength to withstand any force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699 <strong>Metal</strong> \u2013 Precise and unyielding, Metal symbolizes strategy, discipline, and the relentless pursuit of victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca7 <strong>Water</strong> \u2013 Ever-flowing and adaptable, Water embodies wisdom, flexibility, and the power to effortlessly shape its surroundings.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/2d873ca451290cb8ff225d532d55e0ff.webp?t=1746789781\" width=622 height=34 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/645bf8f6acff901c90f2bff5fad5dcf0.avif?t=1746789781\" width=616 height=204 /></span>Dodge, throw, and strategize in real-time. Engage in <strong>intense battles</strong> with up to <strong>4 players</strong>, add up to <strong>4 bots</strong>, and use the integrated <strong>voice chat</strong> to coordinate your team play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/d0c44b0aeea4ac99eccf5f626cac576c.webp?t=1746789781\" width=515 height=34 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/60d01ccd7776131b33f614e12ce05dcf.avif?t=1746789781\" width=616 height=204 /></span>Personalize your space in the lobby just the way you like it! With our <strong>VR Builder</strong>, you can design, modify, and bring your vision to life instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Enter the Arena &amp; Prove Your Skills!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Wishlist now and be the first to wield the elements in battle!</strong> \ud83d\udd25</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/55992c7b036d576a80bd5333a687cb7d.avif?t=1746789781\" width=550 height=73 /></span> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/278755de074d1530ee1d7ae5d6204d66.poster.avif?t=1746789781\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/278755de074d1530ee1d7ae5d6204d66.webm?t=1746789781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/278755de074d1530ee1d7ae5d6204d66.mp4?t=1746789781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Master the Elements. Dominate the Arena. Embrace the Madness!</strong> \ud83d\udd25<br>Enter a world where magic isn\u2019t just power\u2014it\u2019s a way of life. <strong>Magic Madness</strong> is a fast-paced <strong>VR multiplayer battle</strong> where up to <strong>eight opponents</strong> face off in elemental combat, harnessing the raw forces of <strong>wood, fire, earth, metal, and water</strong>. Master unique <strong>spells</strong>, adapt to <strong>dynamic arenas</strong>, and outwit your opponents in a test of <strong>skill, strategy, and reflexes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodge, throw, and cast spells with precision\u2014every move matters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/363fb5e0eb6e3fdb853ceb025c35977a.avif?t=1746789781\" width=456 height=75 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/272c7fab503238940ceb54d3f8199d54.avif?t=1746789781\" width=616 height=204 /></span><strong></strong>Play as a <strong>Brock Lee</strong>, a <strong>Cobra Flash</strong>, or other <strong>unique characters</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/cf032564689774885662d83c0d37251c.webp?t=1746789781\" width=615 height=34 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/a78fdd9f72c4057a1edec15cbd999e05.avif?t=1746789781\" width=616 height=204 /></span><br>\ud83c\udf32 <strong>Wood</strong> \u2013 The essence of growth, renewal, and creative expansion, thriving through flow and adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Fire</strong> \u2013 The element of passion, destruction, and transformation. It fuels chaos and intensity, bringing both danger and renewal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Earth</strong> \u2013 A foundation of stability and endurance. Earth represents resilience, structure, and the strength to withstand any force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699 <strong>Metal</strong> \u2013 Precise and unyielding, Metal symbolizes strategy, discipline, and the relentless pursuit of victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca7 <strong>Water</strong> \u2013 Ever-flowing and adaptable, Water embodies wisdom, flexibility, and the power to effortlessly shape its surroundings.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/2d873ca451290cb8ff225d532d55e0ff.webp?t=1746789781\" width=622 height=34 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/645bf8f6acff901c90f2bff5fad5dcf0.avif?t=1746789781\" width=616 height=204 /></span>Dodge, throw, and strategize in real-time. Engage in <strong>intense battles</strong> with up to <strong>4 players</strong>, add up to <strong>4 bots</strong>, and use the integrated <strong>voice chat</strong> to coordinate your team play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/d0c44b0aeea4ac99eccf5f626cac576c.webp?t=1746789781\" width=515 height=34 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/60d01ccd7776131b33f614e12ce05dcf.avif?t=1746789781\" width=616 height=204 /></span>Personalize your space in the lobby just the way you like it! With our <strong>VR Builder</strong>, you can design, modify, and bring your vision to life instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Enter the Arena &amp; Prove Your Skills!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Wishlist now and be the first to wield the elements in battle!</strong> \ud83d\udd25</p>",
